<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><b>AREAS OF PRÁCTICE</b></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<style is:inline> style="height:20px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:20px;"></div>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpex-max-w-100 wpex-mx-auto wpb_content_element" style="text-align:center;width:500px;">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: center;">The development and complexity of the Law matters in a globalized world makes specialization and sub-specialization of Attorneys-at-Law a “must” necessary in the several fields of Law. Under this perspective the members of CAMYA have become high-quality specialists in diverse legal areas like Civil and Commercial litigation and consultancy, Administrative litigation and consultancy, Tax and Foreign Trade litigation and consultancy, Constitutional Litigation, Strategic Administrative litigation and consultancy, Private Mediation, Corporate Governance, among others.</p>
</div>
</div>
<style is:inline> style="height:20px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:20px;"></div><style is:inline> style="height:40px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:40px;"></div>
